{"id":"en_the-beast-whisperer-rookie-cop-s-revenge","title":"The Beast Whisperer: Rookie Cop's Revenge","titleEn":"The Beast Whisperer: Rookie Cop's Revenge","description":"Freya Stone, a rookie police officer, harbors a secret ability: she can speak with animals. When a kidnapping investigation draws her into a network dealing in human trafficking and organ smuggling, she discovers unsettling links to both her brother's unexplained death and a covert organization known as \"Ghost.\" After being set up by crooked fellow officers, Freya joins forces with her partner, Hudson Cole. Together they harness the city's animal population to dismantle the criminal operation and secure justice for those it has harmed.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-beast-whisperer-rookie-cops-revenge/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-beast-whisperer-rookie-cops-revenge/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Advanture&Action","Contemporary","Female","Inspirational","Male","Paranormal"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dair6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-beast-whisperer-rookie-cop-s-revenge_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dair6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-beast-whisperer-rookie-cop-s-revenge_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dair6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-beast-whisperer-rookie-cop-s-revenge_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dair6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-beas